379	    /**
380	     * Reduce an address to its canonical stored form: trim and collapse runs of
381	     * whitespace to a single space, upper-case, and expand common abbreviations
382	     * ({@code ST -> STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD}, {@code AVE -> AVENUE}) whenever
383	     * they appear as whole words. The result is what is stored, returned and used
384	     * for every household comparison; it is idempotent, so re-normalising an
385	     * already-normalised address leaves it unchanged.
386	     *
387	     * @param value the raw address (may be {@code null})
388	     * @return the normalised address, or the empty string if {@code value} is
389	     *         {@code null} or blank
